@startuml
title DSD - Run Quantum Job (Controller + Service + DAO)

actor User
participant UI
participant Controller <<Controller>>
participant "QuantumJobService" as Service
participant "PostgresQuantumJobDAO" as JobDAO <<DAO>>
participant "AerSimulatorBackend" as Aer <<Expert>>
datastore "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> UI: Select circuit + shots
UI -> Controller: POST /quantum-job
Controller -> Service: submitJob(versionId, shots)
Service -> JobDAO: createJob(PENDING)
JobDAO --> Service: QuantumJob
Service -> Aer: run(circuit, shots)
Aer --> Service: counts
Service -> QuantumJob: transitionTo(COMPLETED)
Service -> JobDAO: update(job)
JobDAO --> DB: UPDATE
JobDAO --> Service: ok
Service --> Controller: JobResponse
Controller --> UI: 200 {jobId, counts}
UI --> User: Show histogram
@enduml